- [38;5;10mvalue_smaller(i3, i10, result)[0m == Ok ✓ (3 < 10 is true → Ok)[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mvalue_smaller(f5.0, f6.5, result)[0m == Ok ✓ (5.0 < 6.5 is true → Ok)[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mbool_and(bt, bt, result)[0m == Ok ✓ (true && true = true → Ok)[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mbool_and(bt, bf, result)[0m != Ok ✓ (true && false = false → not Ok)[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mbool_or(bt, bf, result)[0m == Ok ✓ (true || false = true → Ok)[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mbool_or(bf, bf, result)[0m != Ok ✓ (false || false = false → not Ok)[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mbool_not(bf, result)[0m == Ok ✓ (!false = true → Ok)[0m[0m
[0m[0m
So the pattern is: return Ok when the boolean result is true, return some error when false.[0m[0m
